    "detailed_description": "Embark on a thrilling journey in <strong>Profiteer</strong>, a turn-based strategy game where your primary goal is to gain wealth by any means necessary. Utilize the diverse resources of the game world to build and expand your business empire.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133380/extras/1369d420c3f4390b6e46d4c9cca19268.poster.avif?t=1735062417\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133380/extras/1369d420c3f4390b6e46d4c9cca19268.webm?t=1735062417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133380/extras/1369d420c3f4390b6e46d4c9cca19268.mp4?t=1735062417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2></strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Streamlined Gameplay:</strong> Maximize profits with minimalistic graphics and straightforward mechanics that emphasize strategic depth over complexity.<br></li><li><strong>Diverse Resources:</strong> Manage four essential resources: Minerals, Wood, Oil, and Work-force to optimize your economic growth and outmaneuver competitors.<br></li><li><strong>Challenging AI:</strong> Face off against a smart AI that anticipates your moves, ensuring each victory is both hard-fought and rewarding.<br></li><li><strong>Dynamic World:</strong> Enjoy varied playthroughs with random world generation and multiple map settings, ensuring no two games are the same.<br></li><li><strong>CO-OP Gameplay:</strong> Partner with friends in cooperative mode, combining your strategic minds to dominate the market together.<br></li><li><strong>Extra Features:</strong> Experience the day and night cycle, hear the sounds of industry when your camera is near a factory, and discover other small details that bring the world of Profiteer to life.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133380/extras/ff886edd33cb15ff3471dbe67b0aba46.poster.avif?t=1735062417\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133380/extras/ff886edd33cb15ff3471dbe67b0aba46.webm?t=1735062417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133380/extras/ff886edd33cb15ff3471dbe67b0aba46.mp4?t=1735062417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Prepare to strategize, trade, and conquer in Profiteer\u2014where every decision counts and fortune favors the shrewd.",
